# Pairs with NonDisclosure. The enforcer before #6231: a refused active-tenant
# validation said whether the asserted tenant was registered, so any subject
# could probe tenant ids by asserting them.
MODULE: ReadReasonNamesUnregisteredActiveTenant
TARGET: NonDisclosure
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a refused active-tenant validation reports an unregistered tenant apart from a non-member
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
        activeTenantReason == "activeTenant"
--- REPLACE
        activeTenantReason == IF status["B"] = "active" THEN "activeTenant" ELSE "activeTenantUnregistered"
--- END